{"id": "unknown-2026-10-07-006", "date": "2026-10-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.33, "keywords": ["growth", "decline", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Solar and storage accounted for nearly 1 million EU jobs in 2025", "content": "<p>Solar and battery storage supported 982,000 jobs in the EU in 2025, with PV accounting for 874,000 positions. Solar employment is expected to decline by 2030 as deployment slows, despite growth in operations, maintenance, manufacturing and recycling jobs.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/solar-and-storage-accounted-for-nearly-1-million-eu-jobs-in-2025/\">Solar and storage accounted for nearly 1 million EU jobs in 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/solar-and-storage-accounted-for-nearly-1-million-eu-jobs-in-2025/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-07-007", "date": "2026-10-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "AuroraCell launches 9.7 kWh sodium-ion chromium oxide residential battery", "content": "<p>The 48 V residential energy storage system uses sodium-ion NCO chemistry and offers 9.7 kWh of rated energy. AuroraCell claims a cycle life of 20,000 cycles at 100% depth of discharge and backs the battery with a 20-year warranty.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/auroracell-launches-9-7-kwh-sodium-ion-chromium-oxide-residential-battery/\">AuroraCell launches 9.7 kWh sodium-ion chromium oxide residential battery</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazi", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/auroracell-launches-9-7-kwh-sodium-ion-chromium-oxide-residential-battery/", "type": "rss"}]}
