{"id": "unknown-2026-10-07-011", "date": "2026-10-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "France’s largest battery goes online", "content": "<p>TagEnergy has inaugurated a 240 MW/480 MWh battery storage facility in northeastern France, the country’s largest operational BESS. The Tesla Megapack-based project provides grid-balancing services and is jointly owned by TagEnergy and Banque des Territoires.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/frances-largest-battery-goes-online/\">France&#8217;s largest battery goes online</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/frances-largest-battery-goes-online/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-10-07-012", "date": "2026-10-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 41, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Hithium’s sodium-ion storage push, where it could win, where it won’t, and path to bankability", "content": "<p>After Chinese manufacturer Hithium launched its new 4 MWh sodium-ion BESS alongside its new 785Ah cell for energy storage, in response to questions, Leb Lan, senior product manager, Hithium, spoke with  <b>ESS News</b> to discuss not only the technology developments but also where and when a sodium-ion BESS cabinet will better suit the market than LFP-based battery cell technology.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/hithiums-sodium-ion-storage-push-where-it-could-", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/10/07/hithiums-sodium-ion-storage-push-where-it-could-win-where-it-wont-and-path-to-bankability/", "type": "rss"}]}
